# Nothing but the published site belongs in this repo.
#
# The publish script lives OUTSIDE this folder, at
#   C:\Users\vepasupu\trip-tools\update-site.ps1
# because its redaction rules necessarily name every private string it strips —
# booking references, street addresses, family names. Committing it here served
# that list publicly and defeated the entire point of redacting index.html.
#
# Anything that knows a secret in order to hide it must never live in the repo
# it publishes to.

*.ps1
*.md
*.ics
*.csv
